[
  {
    "id": "sitl31-tab",
    "type": "tab",
    "label": "SITL 14 Param encoding override",
    "disabled": false,
    "info": "Explicit msg.payload.paramEncoding: matching overrides echo-confirm; a crossed AP bytewise override must echo-timeout (proves the override rung).",
    "env": []
  },
  {
    "id": "sitl31-comment",
    "type": "comment",
    "z": "sitl31-tab",
    "name": "paramEncoding override → capabilities → firmware ladder",
    "info": "Inject payloads carry paramEncoding so the §11 ladder does not invent a stack default.\n\n1. PX4: COM_RC_IN_MODE=4 INT32 with paramEncoding bytewise → echo-confirm.\n2. ArduPilot: ARMING_OPTIONS=1 INT32 with paramEncoding c-cast → echo-confirm.\n3. ArduPilot crossed: same ARMING_OPTIONS set with paramEncoding bytewise → must echo-timeout. If the override were ignored, firmware would fall back to c-cast and this set would succeed — so the timeout is what proves the override rung.\n\nConnections mirror SITL 04/21: AP 14550→14551 sysid 1; PX4 14560→14561 sysid 11.",
    "x": 320,
    "y": 40,
    "wires": []
  },
